a> 体系磨合需要时间，等待球队产生质变</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3093">51:33</a> 关窗前总览：森林还缺什么、谁可能离开</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">52:10</a> 外租球员近况与哈钦森赴米兰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3670">01:01:10</a> 莫拉托的去留、出售与外租难题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3917">01:05:17</a> 边中卫/边翼卫轮换人选，以及卡里姆恩多的去留</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4410">01:13:30</a> 若多人离队后的阵容推演</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4563">01:16:03</a> 新翼卫引援分析：穆尼奥斯的价格、年龄与体系适配</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4920">01:22:00</a> 从穆尼奥斯交易延伸：水晶宫卖人逻辑与球队周期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5300">01:28:20</a> 阿姆斯特朗交易未成：报价、风险与球迷反应</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5489">01:31:29</a> 后腰备选与麦卡蒂、桑加雷的搭配</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5670">01:34:30</a> 关窗未知数、夏窗总体评价与节目收尾</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5760">01:36:00</a> 节目片尾</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
